WEBVTT

00:00:28.636 --> 00:00:31.316
It started for many of us
as economies were built.

00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:37.276
But growth rooted in extracting
from our planet and our people

00:00:37.276 --> 00:00:38.476
came at a cost.

00:00:40.036 --> 00:00:41.756
There were warning signs.

00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:45.036
Some of us knew what was happening
to our communities wasn't right,

00:00:45.036 --> 00:00:47.676
that it was connected
to something bigger,

00:00:47.716 --> 00:00:50.596
and the impacts were felt
by some more than others.

00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:53.236
People organized and asked questions.

00:00:53.956 --> 00:00:56.156
Others tried to understand
what was happening

00:00:56.196 --> 00:00:57.676
and sounded the alarm,

00:00:57.716 --> 00:01:00.676
even as others refused to believe
what we told them: